: Prop :=\n  Tool.Is x ∧ x is-a-combination-of Conceptions ∧ ResultsInAProcess x\n\ndef DidNotExistBefore (x : Type) : Prop :=\n  ∃ t : Time, ExistsAt x t ∧ ∃ t₀ : Time, Precedes t₀ t ∧ ¬ ExistsAt x t₀\n\ndef Invention (x : Type) : Prop :=\n  ToolHasGeneralProperties x ∧ DidNotExistBefore x\n\nend Information\n\nend xmafsdvf\n","members":[],"source_lines":{"end":24,"start":24},"theorem_statement":null},"referenced_by":[{"def_id":"fm51n7gw","display_kind":"definition","file_id":"xmafsdvf","kind":"definition","local_name":"Information.IsACombinationOf","qualified_name":"xmafsdvf.Information.IsACombinationOf"}]}
